{"ticker":"ES","updated":"2026-10-30T22:47:02Z","profile":{"longName":"Eversource Energy","shortName":"Eversource Energy (D/B/A)","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.eversource.com","fullTimeEmployees":10731,"marketCap":25821054976,"trailingPE":17.75907,"forwardPE":13.911665,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.8445754,"pegRatio":2.23,"targetMeanPrice":71.69231,"targetHighPrice":85.0,"targetLowPrice":49.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.023,"earningsGrowth":-0.854,"grossMargins":0.52752,"operatingMargins":0.23923,"profitMargins":0.10354,"totalRevenue":13998372864,"beta":0.679,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":76.57,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.72,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.64},"summary":"Eversource Energy, a public utility holding company, engages in the energy delivery business. The company operates through Electric Distribution, Electric Transmission, Natural Gas Distribution, and Water Distribution segments. It is involved in the transmission and distribution of electricity; solar power facilities; and distribution of natural gas. The company also operates regulated water utilities that provides water services to residential, commercial, industrial, municipal and fire protection, and other customers in Connecticut, Massachusetts, and New Hampshire. The company was formerly known as Northeast Utilities and changed its name to Eversource Energy in April 2015. Eversource Energy was incorporated in 1927 and is headquartered in Springfield, Massachusetts.","summary_zh":"Eversource Energy是一家公用事業控股公司，從事能源輸送業務。該公司透過配電、輸電、天然氣分銷和供水部門營運。它涉及電力的傳輸和分配；太陽能發電設施；和天然氣的分配。該公司還經營受監管的自來水公司，為康乃狄克州、麻薩諸塞州和新罕布夏州的住宅、商業、工業、市政和消防以及其他客戶提供供水服務。該公司前身為 Northeast Utilities，於 2015 年 4 月更名為 Eversource Energy。 Eversource Energy 成立於 1927 年，總部位於麻薩諸塞州斯普林菲爾德。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":63.75,"h":64.14,"l":63.02